      <h1><span class="nowrap">Press the KVM button.</span><br><span class="hl nowrap">Your devices follow.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">
        AutoSwitch KVM moves your Bluetooth keyboard, mouse and trackpad to whichever computer your
        KVM switch picks. Apple Magic accessories, Logitech Easy-Switch keyboards and mice, and more.
        No Bluetooth settings. No re-pairing. No channel keys. You just switch.
      </p>
      <div class="cta" data-downloads>
        <a class="btn btn--primary" data-os="mac" href="{{ site.download.mac }}">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v12m0 0-5-5m5 5 5-5M5 21h14"/></svg>
